---
// The v2 delivery path, one shared mental model the rest of the post refers back to.
// Order in → ingress stamps a sequence number and tees to the journal → single-writer
// engine matches off the inbound ring → emits into the outbound multicast ring → N
// projection shards + the market-data consumer each read it on their own cursor →
// per-client reliable lanes + the lossy broadcast lane → tokio workers write 250 sockets.
const W = 900, H = 320;
const cx = { in: 50, ingress: 182, engine: 348, ring: 474, shards: 620, clients: 852 };
const midY = 158;
---
<figure class="chart flow">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="The v2 delivery path. Orders arrive and hit the ingress sequencer, which stamps a sequence number and tees each order to the durable journal in parallel while handing it to the engine over the inbound ring. The single-writer engine matches and emits events into an outbound multicast ring. Four projection shards and one market-data consumer each read that ring on their own cursor; the producer gates on the slowest. The shards route per-client acks and fills onto reliable lanes, and the market-data consumer broadcasts snapshots on a lossy lane. Tokio worker threads serialize and write both lanes out to 250 client sockets.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="fa" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--muted)" /></marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- orders in -->
    <text x={cx.in} y={midY - 5} text-anchor="middle" class="io">orders</text>
    <text x={cx.in} y={midY + 9} text-anchor="middle" class="io dim">in</text>
    <line x1={cx.in + 30} y1={midY} x2={cx.ingress - 48} y2={midY} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#fa)" />

    <!-- journal tee (up), label below its box -->
    <line x1={cx.ingress} y1={midY - 20} x2={cx.ingress} y2={70} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    <rect x={cx.ingress - 44} y={44} width={88} height={26} rx="5" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={cx.ingress} y={61} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">journal</text>
    <text x={cx.ingress} y={30} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">tee · off the hot path</text>

    <!-- ingress -->
    <rect x={cx.ingress - 46} y={midY - 20} width={92} height={40} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x={cx.ingress} y={midY - 3} text-anchor="middle" class="bt">ingress</text>
    <text x={cx.ingress} y={midY + 12} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">stamp seq</text>

    <!-- inbound ring arrow (roomy gap); label above, clear of both boxes -->
    <line x1={cx.ingress + 46} y1={midY} x2={cx.engine - 46} y2={midY} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    <text x={(cx.ingress + cx.engine) / 2} y={midY - 30} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">inbound</text>
    <text x={(cx.ingress + cx.engine) / 2} y={midY - 18} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">ring</text>

    <!-- engine -->
    <rect x={cx.engine - 46} y={midY - 22} width={92} height={44} rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x={cx.engine} y={midY - 3} text-anchor="middle" class="bt">engine</text>
    <text x={cx.engine} y={midY + 12} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">1 writer, spins</text>

    <!-- outbound ring -->
    <line x1={cx.engine + 46} y1={midY} x2={cx.ring - 20} y2={midY} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    <rect x={cx.ring - 20} y={midY - 48} width={40} height={96} rx="6" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={cx.ring} y={midY - 2} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">out</text>
    <text x={cx.ring} y={midY + 11} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">ring</text>
    <text x={cx.ring} y={midY + 66} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">multicast</text>

    <!-- fan to 4 shards + MD consumer -->
    {[0,1,2,3].map((i) => {
      const y = 84 + i * 32;
      return (
        <g>
          <line x1={cx.ring + 20} y1={midY} x2={cx.shards - 54} y2={y + 11} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
          <rect x={cx.shards - 54} y={y} width={108} height={23} rx="5" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" />
          <text x={cx.shards} y={y + 15} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">shard {i}</text>
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <line x1={cx.ring + 20} y1={midY} x2={cx.shards - 54} y2={240} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    <rect x={cx.shards - 54} y={228} width={108} height={23} rx="5" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={cx.shards} y={243} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">MD consumer</text>

    <!-- lanes: reliable (from shards, accent) + lossy (from MD, muted), labels above/below the arrow bundle -->
    <text x={(cx.shards + cx.clients) / 2} y={72} text-anchor="middle" class="lane acc">reliable lanes</text>
    <text x={(cx.shards + cx.clients) / 2} y={85} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">per client · seq'd</text>
    {[0,1,2,3].map((i) => (
      <line x1={cx.shards + 54} y1={95 + i * 32} x2={cx.clients - 36} y2={midY - 18 + i * 5} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.55" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    ))}
    <line x1={cx.shards + 54} y1={239} x2={cx.clients - 36} y2={midY + 20} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.65" marker-end="url(#fa)" />
    <text x={(cx.shards + cx.clients) / 2} y={264} text-anchor="middle" class="lane mut">lossy broadcast</text>
    <text x={(cx.shards + cx.clients) / 2} y={277} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">20 Hz snapshots</text>

    <!-- clients -->
    <rect x={cx.clients - 36} y={midY - 30} width={72} height={60} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--fg)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x={cx.clients} y={midY - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="bt">250</text>
    <text x={cx.clients} y={midY + 9} text-anchor="middle" class="bs">clients</text>
    <text x={cx.clients} y={midY + 24} text-anchor="middle" class="tag">sockets</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>The v2 delivery path; every round in this post is a bottleneck somewhere on it. Ingress tees each order to the durable journal in parallel with handing it to the single-writer engine, which matches off a lock-free inbound ring and emits events into an outbound <em>multicast</em> ring. Four projection shards and one market-data consumer each read that ring on their own cursor, the producer gating on the slowest. Shards route acks and fills onto <span class="acck">reliable lanes</span> (sequence-numbered, a gap is a bug); the market-data consumer broadcasts snapshots on the <span class="mutk">lossy lane</span> (drops self-heal on the next tick). Tokio workers write both out to 250 sockets.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow :global(.io) { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
  .flow :global(.io.dim) { font-size: 10px; fill: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .flow :global(.bt) { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
  .flow :global(.bs) { font-size: 10px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .flow :global(.tag) { font-size: 9.5px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .flow :global(.lane) { font-size: 10.5px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
  .flow :global(.lane.acc) { fill: var(--accent); }
  .flow :global(.lane.mut) { fill: var(--muted); }
  .flow figcaption .acck { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .flow figcaption .mutk { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
